## Publication content is not MIT by default

Normal publication directories under `books/<slug>/` are outside the MIT grant above unless their own rights file expressly says otherwise.

Manuscripts, illustrations, photographs, cover art, audio, and other publication content remain copyright of their respective rightsholders. The Bookself default for a real publication is **All Rights Reserved**. Public visibility, Git source availability, or inclusion in a public Shelf does not by itself grant permission to reproduce, republish, distribute, sell, adapt, translate, train or fine-tune AI systems on, ingest into generative AI systems, or otherwise exploit the publication.

A publication may deliberately choose a different license in its own `RIGHTS.md`. That publication-specific file controls the author's intended grant for that work, subject to applicable law and separate hosting-provider terms.

See [RIGHTS.md](RIGHTS.md) and [docs/rights-and-ai.md](docs/rights-and-ai.md) for the rights model and AI-use defaults.